-- AFTER <date> is the instant the window opens; it has nothing to count
-- from, so an anchor on it is refused (EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §5.1.2).
IMPORT daydate

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Buyer
    Seller

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay
    Deliver

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS
    PARTY Seller MUST Deliver WITHIN 10
    HENCE (PARTY Buyer MUST Pay AFTER (YMD 2026 6 1) OF THE JOIN WITHIN 5)
